DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260822T113000
UID:53c7d6b4b2b90f6e0db1dab8d1ece418@montclairfilm.org
DESCRIPTION:The Paw Patrol lands on a mysterious dinosaur island after a s
 torm\, where they meet Rex\, a stranded pup. When Humdinger's reckless min
 ing triggers a volcano\, the team faces their biggest rescue mission yet t
 o save the island.
LOCATION:The Bellevue\, 260 Bellevue Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ 07043
URL:https://www.montclairfilm.org/events/pawpatrolthedinomovie/
X-SOURCE:Montclair Film
END:VEVENT
