  remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without
  him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to contro
 l. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a sh
 ocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no o
 ne can even see.
